WEBVTT

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:14.590
<i>GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:18.720
Why you...! Say that again!

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.230
This is the end!

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:33.740
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.700
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:40.410
<i>See? In the darkness behind you...</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.230
<i>Slumbering in bed in the morning</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.230
<i>asa wa nedoko de gu gu gu</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>Ghosts don't have school</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>obakenya gakkou mo</i>

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.610
<i>Or tests or anything</i>

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.610
<i>shiken mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:14.050 --> 00:02:15.510
What a lovely bath.

00:02:15.920 --> 00:02:19.300
Shall we be going, Kitaro?

00:02:22.760 --> 00:02:23.930
Kitaro?

00:02:24.640 --> 00:02:27.640
Dad... It's gone.

00:02:27.770 --> 00:02:29.100
My...

00:02:29.560 --> 00:02:31.860
My <i>chanchanko</i>...

00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:33.730
It's gone.

00:02:34.570 --> 00:02:35.480
CHAPTER 71

00:02:36.110 --> 00:02:40.450
KARAKASA'S UMBRELLA TROUBLES

00:02:40.570 --> 00:02:44.450
<i>SOKAI</i> LIVELY APARTMENT

00:02:53.090 --> 00:02:55.800
What's wrong, Karakasa?
What are you sighing for?

00:02:57.090 --> 00:02:57.760
Well...

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:01.760
I was thinking
modern umbrellas are so stylish.

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:05.260
I guess ones like me are old-fashioned.

00:03:05.810 --> 00:03:08.100
I wouldn't say that.

00:03:08.230 --> 00:03:11.770
It's not like you to be melancholic.

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:15.440
Days like this make me think back.

00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:20.240
When I was still in use,
I was well looked after.

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:26.450
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:03:26.580 --> 00:03:30.620
Oh man. Who can handle
sudden rain like this?

00:03:31.620 --> 00:03:33.710
Hey, Rat Man, what do you want?

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:36.460
I don't want anything. Just some shelter.

00:03:36.920 --> 00:03:38.420
Shelter?

00:03:38.760 --> 00:03:42.800
Shelter, is it?! Oh very well.

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:45.220
In that case, I guess I can help out.

00:03:45.350 --> 00:03:46.100
Huh?

00:03:46.220 --> 00:03:49.020
Use me! No need to be modest!

00:03:49.140 --> 00:03:51.810
Huh? Uh, that's okay. No thanks.

00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:54.650
Oh come on!
I said no need for modesty!

00:03:54.770 --> 00:03:56.360
I'm not being modest.

00:03:56.730 --> 00:04:02.860
Who knows what people will say
if I carry around an old thing like you.

00:04:03.740 --> 00:04:07.780
What?! I was being considerate here!

00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:10.500
That's it! Let's go!

00:04:11.620 --> 00:04:13.080
Move it!

00:04:13.210 --> 00:04:15.580
Natsumi! I'll be back later!

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:18.670
Okay.

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:25.050
They're so pretty.

00:04:26.050 --> 00:04:28.640
Ooh! That one's nice, too!

00:04:29.470 --> 00:04:31.930
Oh wow! Check that out!

00:04:32.890 --> 00:04:34.560
Seriously! Shut up already!

00:04:34.690 --> 00:04:39.570
If you're so jealous, go wear Kitaro's
<i>chanchanko</i> and become a plastic umbrella!

00:04:39.690 --> 00:04:41.570
Kitaro's <i>chanchanko</i>?

00:04:41.690 --> 00:04:43.780
Don't you know?

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:47.910
If other <i>yokai</i> wear his <i>chanchanko</i>
and wish strongly,

00:04:48.030 --> 00:04:50.330
they can transform into anything.

00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:52.580
Huh. I've never heard that.

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:56.830
It's a special <i>chanchanko</i> woven from
the spirit hair of his ancestors.

00:04:56.960 --> 00:05:02.170
Obviously Kitaro treasures it,
so he'd never lend it to anyone.

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:05.430
So if you really want it,
you'd have to steal it...

00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:07.390
Ouch!

00:05:07.510 --> 00:05:09.970
You moron! Show some respect!

00:05:10.100 --> 00:05:13.680
I owe Kitaro! How could I do that?!

00:05:20.980 --> 00:05:22.860
So pretty...

00:05:23.650 --> 00:05:27.660
So slender... Talk about
breathtakingly refined umbrellas.

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:31.790
Honestly. What point is there
if you won't cover me?

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:33.290
Hey, are you listening?!

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:37.500
-Hold it!
-What?

00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:39.000
I'm sure of it!

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:42.090
That guy! He took the wrong umbrella!

00:05:43.010 --> 00:05:47.680
He took a different umbrella from the one
he was using when he went in!

00:05:48.430 --> 00:05:50.100
It's an emergency!

00:05:50.220 --> 00:05:51.640
Hey, wait!

00:06:02.480 --> 00:06:06.400
Now's my chance to switch these.

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:17.790
Oh no! Stop!

00:06:18.830 --> 00:06:23.460
Th-That bastard! He left the umbrella
he took by mistake!

00:06:23.880 --> 00:06:25.460
Dammit!

00:06:30.050 --> 00:06:31.300
Get back here!

00:06:32.760 --> 00:06:34.060
Kou-chan, welcome home.

00:06:34.180 --> 00:06:35.430
I'm back.

00:06:35.930 --> 00:06:37.430
That's his home.

00:06:37.560 --> 00:06:39.690
Seriously, how careless.

00:06:40.270 --> 00:06:44.940
Your owner was tired.
Everyone makes mistakes sometimes.

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:46.190
Don't worry.

00:06:46.860 --> 00:06:48.950
But, I feel sorry for you.

00:06:49.070 --> 00:06:52.030
I can't find your original owner now.

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:54.790
But, this must be fate.

00:06:55.620 --> 00:06:57.660
He can look after you.

00:07:04.840 --> 00:07:07.260
There we go. I should leave.

00:07:12.180 --> 00:07:13.470
Huh? This...

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:16.970
<i>A touching reunion with his umbrellas.</i>

00:07:17.890 --> 00:07:20.520
Not a bad job if I say so myself.

00:07:21.900 --> 00:07:22.980
Huh?

00:07:23.690 --> 00:07:25.980
Whose umbrellas are these?

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:27.110
Huh?

00:07:27.230 --> 00:07:28.780
What's wrong, Kou-chan?

00:07:28.900 --> 00:07:31.740
Well, someone left
these strange umbrellas.

00:07:31.860 --> 00:07:32.820
Huh?

00:07:33.450 --> 00:07:34.410
Whose are they?

00:07:34.530 --> 00:07:35.580
I dunno.

00:07:35.700 --> 00:07:39.910
<i>Wait, seriously?
You were just carrying them!</i>

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:42.500
These are kinda filthy.

00:07:45.130 --> 00:07:46.000
Let's go.

00:07:46.130 --> 00:07:48.380
Okay. What should we eat?

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:55.600
Impossible! Who doesn't recognize
their own umbrella?

00:07:55.720 --> 00:07:58.270
That guy... I'll show him!

00:08:05.900 --> 00:08:09.900
<i>You used those umbrellas.
Notice them... Notice them...</i>

00:08:14.450 --> 00:08:15.320
Huh?!

00:08:15.870 --> 00:08:18.490
N-Not even a second glance?!

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:24.460
Don't worry. I, Karakasa,

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:29.630
will make sure
that bastard remembers you!

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:34.430
Notice them!

00:08:39.220 --> 00:08:40.310
Dammit!

00:08:46.360 --> 00:08:48.020
You bastard!

00:08:53.490 --> 00:08:57.620
Wh-Why?
Why doesn't he notice after all this?!

00:08:57.740 --> 00:09:00.870
He doesn't even
pick them up to look at them!

00:09:03.330 --> 00:09:04.290
It's rain!

00:09:05.580 --> 00:09:07.130
Oh no! It's raining!

00:09:07.630 --> 00:09:08.380
Huh?

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:13.470
Just our luck!

00:09:17.220 --> 00:09:18.680
Thank goodness.

00:09:20.180 --> 00:09:23.560
Well, they're in his house now.

00:09:24.430 --> 00:09:30.820
He may have forgotten the past, but you
can build new memories together now.

00:09:36.950 --> 00:09:39.280
I should check on them tomorrow.

00:09:42.540 --> 00:09:44.750
Okay! That takes care of the clutter.

00:09:44.870 --> 00:09:49.130
Plastic umbrellas just pile up
before you realize it.

00:09:54.340 --> 00:09:56.630
What?! Why?!

00:09:56.760 --> 00:09:59.220
Why'd he throw you away again?!

00:09:59.340 --> 00:10:04.220
Why do perfectly usable umbrellas
have to be treated this way?!

00:10:05.180 --> 00:10:10.310
At this rate, he's going to continue
throwing umbrellas away.

00:10:10.440 --> 00:10:11.940
What can I do?

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:16.030
Don't you know?

00:10:16.150 --> 00:10:20.240
If other <i>yokai</i> wear his <i>chanchanko</i>
and wish strongly,

00:10:20.370 --> 00:10:22.990
they can transform into anything.

00:10:31.750 --> 00:10:35.920
Bathing in hot springs once in a while
is great, right Dad?

00:10:36.050 --> 00:10:37.260
Indeed.

00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:39.680
I feel my fatigue melting away.

00:10:49.270 --> 00:10:52.440
Kitaro, I'm really sorry. I'll return it.

00:10:59.450 --> 00:11:00.660
I'm...

00:11:01.370 --> 00:11:04.910
I'm going to straighten that kid out!

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:09.460
FIGHTING JUST MAKES YOU HUNGRY

00:11:10.540 --> 00:11:13.960
ROKURO-KUBI

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:12.960
<i>-"Ge."
-"Ge."</i>

00:11:13.090 --> 00:11:13.960
<i>"Ge."</i>

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:23.680
Oh man. The forecast said it'd be sunny.

00:11:23.800 --> 00:11:25.470
Hello, young man!

00:11:29.390 --> 00:11:31.900
Here, I'll give you this umbrella!

00:11:32.020 --> 00:11:32.770
Huh?

00:11:32.900 --> 00:11:36.150
No need to be modest. Just take it!

00:11:36.280 --> 00:11:37.900
Uh, well...

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:42.610
Listen. You don't have to return it to me.

00:11:42.740 --> 00:11:45.370
From now on this is your umbrella.

00:11:45.490 --> 00:11:46.580
It's yours.

00:11:46.700 --> 00:11:48.370
Your umbrella.

00:11:48.500 --> 00:11:51.460
Take good care of it. Got it?

00:11:51.670 --> 00:11:54.750
Uh, er, well... Yes, sir.

00:11:58.380 --> 00:12:00.590
What was with that guy?

00:12:12.190 --> 00:12:14.690
I'm sorry, everyone.

00:12:14.810 --> 00:12:18.110
Could you all help me find my <i>chanchanko</i>?

00:12:18.230 --> 00:12:20.110
I'm asking you, too.

00:12:20.570 --> 00:12:24.240
If you find anything,
anything at all, let us know.

00:12:29.120 --> 00:12:30.160
Hey!

00:12:30.750 --> 00:12:33.250
Kid! What did I tell you?!

00:12:33.370 --> 00:12:34.120
Huh?

00:12:34.250 --> 00:12:37.250
This! You left it in your classroom.

00:12:37.380 --> 00:12:40.380
Listen! Don't forget it again!

00:12:40.510 --> 00:12:43.220
This is your umbrella! Got it?

00:12:43.550 --> 00:12:44.430
Um...

00:12:44.550 --> 00:12:45.510
Speak up!

00:12:45.640 --> 00:12:47.140
Uh, y-yes, sir.

00:12:47.260 --> 00:12:50.720
Now take it home and take good care of it.

00:12:50.850 --> 00:12:52.180
Yes, sir.

00:12:55.730 --> 00:12:58.770
Hey! You left it on the bench!

00:13:01.150 --> 00:13:04.490
That's the third time this week
you've mistaken it!

00:13:11.870 --> 00:13:14.580
Good! Keep it up!

00:13:15.540 --> 00:13:16.960
Dammit!

00:13:17.080 --> 00:13:19.500
What the heck is that guy's problem?!

00:13:27.390 --> 00:13:29.220
Sorry to bother you so late.

00:13:30.220 --> 00:13:31.930
Give this to your boyfriend.

00:13:32.060 --> 00:13:32.810
Huh?

00:13:33.310 --> 00:13:35.890
It's not much.
Just some Japanese confectionery.

00:13:36.020 --> 00:13:37.310
Th-Thank you.

00:13:37.730 --> 00:13:43.400
He's forgetting his umbrella less often,
so I bought this as a reward.

00:13:43.530 --> 00:13:45.990
Please enjoy it. That's all.

00:13:46.110 --> 00:13:46.990
Excuse me.

00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:55.830
You gotta reward them when necessary.

00:13:55.960 --> 00:13:59.540
It looks like he's
taking care of his umbrella now.

00:13:59.670 --> 00:14:02.880
I should return this <i>chanchanko</i> to Kitaro.

00:14:03.380 --> 00:14:04.800
Dammit!

00:14:07.430 --> 00:14:11.430
That damn stalker! I've had it!

00:14:16.560 --> 00:14:18.560
Huh? Kitaro, what's up?

00:14:19.310 --> 00:14:23.650
I'm looking for my <i>chanchanko</i>.
Have you heard anything?

00:14:23.780 --> 00:14:26.450
Your <i>chanchanko</i>?
Why the hell would I know...

00:14:26.570 --> 00:14:28.700
Wait... Hold on...

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:30.280
Huh?

00:14:31.660 --> 00:14:34.120
Nah, he'd never do that.

00:14:34.240 --> 00:14:37.000
Rat Man! What do you know?

00:14:37.120 --> 00:14:40.420
N-Nothing!
I'm pretty sure I'm wrong, but...

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:42.040
The other day...

00:14:43.210 --> 00:14:45.760
We're looking for Karakasa, too.

00:14:46.130 --> 00:14:49.260
He hasn't been back since he last left.

00:14:51.890 --> 00:14:57.270
Hmm... It seems likely that Karakasa is
involved with this case.

00:14:57.390 --> 00:15:00.440
But why would he...

00:15:02.110 --> 00:15:03.480
What's wrong, Kitaro?

00:15:04.480 --> 00:15:08.150
"Beware of suspicious individual
known as 'Umbrella Man.'

00:15:08.490 --> 00:15:11.530
If seen, call the police"?

00:15:11.660 --> 00:15:13.530
Umbrella Man?

00:15:28.760 --> 00:15:31.510
Wh... What is he doing?!

00:15:33.050 --> 00:15:34.510
Stop!

00:15:37.520 --> 00:15:40.440
You can't do that! What's wrong with you?!

00:15:41.850 --> 00:15:43.020
That's him!

00:15:43.440 --> 00:15:45.230
Stop! It's the police!

00:15:47.030 --> 00:15:48.690
Hey! What's going on?!

00:15:48.820 --> 00:15:49.860
Settle down!

00:15:49.990 --> 00:15:51.530
Let go! Let go of me!

00:15:51.660 --> 00:15:53.160
Be quiet!

00:15:53.280 --> 00:15:57.120
Dammit! You tricked me!

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:02.420
You bastards! That's enough!

00:16:04.290 --> 00:16:05.460
A monster!

00:16:09.210 --> 00:16:10.920
G-Get back!

00:16:11.050 --> 00:16:13.220
You disappoint me.

00:16:14.260 --> 00:16:16.970
I wanted you to change your ways.

00:16:17.100 --> 00:16:20.180
That's why I took my time with you.

00:16:20.640 --> 00:16:22.690
But I've had enough!

00:16:24.650 --> 00:16:29.280
People who don't take care of umbrellas
need a little punishment!

00:16:29.400 --> 00:16:33.200
Wait a minute!
When did I treat umbrellas badly?!

00:16:33.320 --> 00:16:35.570
Shut up! I've been watching you!

00:16:36.160 --> 00:16:39.330
You mistake umbrellas
and forget them easily.

00:16:39.450 --> 00:16:43.170
On top of that,
you threw away usable umbrellas!

00:16:43.290 --> 00:16:47.420
Wh-What? Are you stupid?!
That's just normal!

00:16:47.590 --> 00:16:50.210
It's not just me! Everyone does that!

00:16:50.340 --> 00:16:51.470
What?!

00:16:51.920 --> 00:16:53.590
Dad, look.

00:16:53.720 --> 00:16:57.470
Plastic umbrellas are supposed to be
cheap and easy to buy!

00:16:57.600 --> 00:17:01.430
Nobody cares for
such disposable umbrellas!

00:17:03.730 --> 00:17:07.060
Disposable umbrellas?!

00:17:08.440 --> 00:17:11.320
Why you...! Say that again!

00:17:12.950 --> 00:17:14.150
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:17:17.410 --> 00:17:18.830
Help me!

00:17:20.740 --> 00:17:21.830
Kitaro.

00:17:21.950 --> 00:17:24.830
Karakasa, that's enough.

00:17:25.420 --> 00:17:29.460
Kitaro, I'm sorry for what I did to you.

00:17:30.340 --> 00:17:34.760
But I can't bring myself to forgive him!

00:17:35.260 --> 00:17:38.140
Get out of my way!

00:17:50.360 --> 00:17:54.950
Kitaro, his <i>yokai</i> power is
being boosted by the <i>chanchanko</i>!

00:17:55.070 --> 00:17:56.450
Watch out!

00:17:56.570 --> 00:17:57.950
Right, Dad!

00:18:00.490 --> 00:18:01.490
Hair Needles!

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:03.750
That won't work!

00:18:07.540 --> 00:18:08.710
Too slow!

00:18:17.890 --> 00:18:19.930
Umbrella Rib Needles!

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:26.060
This is the end!

00:18:28.190 --> 00:18:29.150
Kitaro!

00:18:38.950 --> 00:18:41.870
It hurts! What is this?!

00:18:44.660 --> 00:18:45.830
I see.

00:18:45.950 --> 00:18:51.040
Our ancestors' <i>yokai</i> power imbued in
the <i>chanchanko</i> is protecting you, Kitaro.

00:18:58.590 --> 00:19:01.390
I'm taking my <i>chanchanko</i> back.

00:19:03.510 --> 00:19:06.430
I'm the worst, Kitaro.

00:19:08.350 --> 00:19:12.060
I owe you,
yet I stole your precious <i>chanchanko</i>.

00:19:12.190 --> 00:19:14.360
I even punched you...

00:19:14.480 --> 00:19:16.070
I'm a disgrace!

00:19:16.570 --> 00:19:19.950
Karakasa, your methods were wrong.

00:19:20.410 --> 00:19:24.030
But, we understand
your compassion for umbrellas now.

00:19:25.040 --> 00:19:26.330
Kitaro...

00:19:26.910 --> 00:19:29.410
You were able to transform
with the <i>chanchanko</i>

00:19:29.540 --> 00:19:35.460
because your wish for humans to
appreciate umbrellas was so strong.

00:19:35.840 --> 00:19:39.470
We can see your sincerity.

00:19:39.590 --> 00:19:41.890
I'm sorry! I'm so sorry!

00:19:42.510 --> 00:19:45.850
I was jealous of modern umbrellas.

00:19:46.600 --> 00:19:49.980
They're pretty and stylish.
I idolized them.

00:19:50.730 --> 00:19:54.190
But I realized they have it much worse.

00:19:54.860 --> 00:19:58.440
Modern umbrellas don't know
an owner's love.

00:19:58.570 --> 00:20:00.740
How sad is that?

00:20:01.860 --> 00:20:04.910
Wh-What did I do?!

00:20:05.030 --> 00:20:10.960
I wasn't especially bad to umbrellas!
Everybody acts that way!

00:20:11.920 --> 00:20:14.210
Things can always be replaced.

00:20:14.330 --> 00:20:19.880
That sort of thinking has led to people
growing up not appreciating things.

00:20:20.010 --> 00:20:22.010
It's a sad truth.

00:20:36.900 --> 00:20:38.190
Karakasa.

00:20:43.240 --> 00:20:44.320
Here.

00:20:46.990 --> 00:20:50.200
Umbrella applique and a handle cover.

00:20:50.790 --> 00:20:55.460
They sell these to help people
recognize their umbrellas these days.

00:20:56.920 --> 00:20:58.960
These are... for me?

00:20:59.090 --> 00:21:04.970
Well, you mentioned how stylish modern
umbrellas are. I thought you'd like them.

00:21:05.090 --> 00:21:07.300
N-Natsumi...

00:21:08.720 --> 00:21:13.440
Karakasa, it's true many people don't
look after their things.

00:21:13.560 --> 00:21:19.110
But there are people like Natsumi-chan
with kind hearts, too.

00:21:19.610 --> 00:21:21.570
Don't despair.

00:21:36.000 --> 00:21:40.670
Good grief. The weather's so unstable
this time of year.

00:21:40.800 --> 00:21:42.010
Rat Man.

00:21:42.130 --> 00:21:44.510
K-Karakasa, you...

00:21:44.970 --> 00:21:46.930
What's with the getup?

00:21:47.050 --> 00:21:48.470
Isn't it cute?

00:21:48.600 --> 00:21:52.520
Okay! You can use me again!
Come on now!

00:21:52.640 --> 00:21:56.730
G-Give me a break!

